 ns: cisacfellowship@stanford.edu.\n\nOrganisation: Center for Internationa
 l Security and Cooperation (CISAC)\, Stanford FSI\nLocation: Stanford\, Ca
 lifornia\, USA (in-residence\; fellows are expected to be fully present an
