 lities with Beta Festival (XR\, three EUR 15\,000 grants)
DESCRIPTION:Realities in Transition (RiT2)\, a Creative Europe XR cooperati
 on project\, and Beta Festival in Ireland invite artists\, technologists\,
  storytellers\, engineers\, hackers and designers to develop XR\, interact
 ive\, multi-user work that explores technology through relationships betwe
 en human\, artificial and more-than-human intelligence\, with a focus on d
 ecolonial thinking and interdependence. Three artists are selected\, each 
 paired with a creative technologist and working as a group. WHAT YOU GET: 
 a EUR 15\,000 grant per artist for a six-month hybrid residency from March
  to August 2027\, with an in-person period at Beta in May to June 2027\, a
  Test Lab in June 2027 and a showcase at Beta Festival in November 2027. A
 PPLICATION: online form linked from the call page\; see the RiT residencie
 s page for eligibility. DEADLINE: 10 November 2026\, 23:59 CEST.\n\nOrgani
 sation: Realities in Transition (RiT2\, Creative Europe)\, with Beta Festi
 val\nLocation: Hybrid residency hosted by Beta Festival\, Dublin\, Ireland
  (in person May to June 2027). Check the RiT residencies page for country 
 eligibility.\nAward: Three grants of EUR 15\,000 each\, one per selected a
 rtist. No application fee mentioned.\nDuration: 6-month hybrid residency\,
  March to August 2027\, in person at Beta in May to June 2027\; Test Lab i
 n June 2027 and showcase at Beta Festival in November 2027.\n\nMore: https
 ://www.realities-in-transition.eu/rit-2-open-call-4/?utm_source=artificial
 nouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
