 REA-MEDIA-2027-INNOVBUSMOD) funds tools and business models that strengthe
 n the competitiveness of the European audiovisual and video games industri
 es. WHAT IT FUNDS: tools for subtitling\, accessibility\, discoverability 
 and recommendation\; automated rights management and data analytics\; busi
 ness models linking festivals\, cinemas and VOD\; new modes of production\
 , financing or distribution using AI\, big data\, blockchain\, virtual wor
 lds or NFTs\; and greening the audiovisual and video games industry. WHO: 
 a single organisation or a consortium of two or more\, established in a ME
 DIA country\; individuals cannot apply. WHAT YOU GET: grants at an 80 perc
 ent funding rate from a total budget of EUR 14\,000\,000. APPLICATION: via
  the EU Funding and Tenders portal. DEADLINE: 14 January 2027\, 17:00 CET 
