 \,000\,000\; no fixed cap per project\; 80 percent funding rate. No applic
 ation fee.\nDuration: Projects normally up to 36 months. Call opened 30 Se
 ptember 2026.\n\nMore: https://ec.europa.eu/info/funding-tenders/opportuni
 ties/portal/screen/opportunities/topic-details/CREA-MEDIA-2027-INNOVBUSMOD
