SUMMARY:Deadline: FAI Conservative AI Policy Fellowship\, Winter 2027 (Wash
 ington DC\, part-time\, USD 1\,500 stipend)
DESCRIPTION:The Foundation for American Innovation's Conservative AI Policy
  Fellowship is an eight-week\, part-time\, work-compatible programme on AI
  policy for conservative policy professionals in Washington DC. WHO: congr
 essional and executive branch staff\, policy researchers and think tank st
 aff\, tech professionals moving into AI policy\, and exceptional early-car
 eer applicants\; no technical AI background is required. FORMAT: weekly in
